WEBVTT

00:15:29.476 --> 00:15:31.236
having access to health care.

00:15:31.236 --> 00:15:35.316
All of those things
really matter for our health.

00:15:36.396 --> 00:15:38.676
WPR: And you start the book
with a question.

00:15:38.716 --> 00:15:41.556
You say, "If you had to make
one life choice right now

00:15:41.556 --> 00:15:44.316
to set yourself on the path
to future health and happiness,

00:15:44.356 --> 00:15:45.596
what would it be?"

00:15:45.636 --> 00:15:47.236
And from hearing your talk today,

00:15:47.236 --> 00:15:49.396
we know that the right answer
to that question

00:15:49.436 --> 00:15:51.396
is to build more warm connections.

00:15:51.396 --> 00:15:55.076
But I want to ask you
about the use of the word "choice" there

00:15:55.116 --> 00:15:59.156
and understanding more about whether
or not having warm connections

00:15:59.196 --> 00:16:01.316
is a choice that we make